title: Commvault VMs
agents: commvault_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Summary of all virtual machines known to Commvault (retired VMs are not
 counted): number of VMs per SLA and protection status. VMs that missed their
 SLA and VMs with status FAILED (not excluded from SLA) are WARN, VMs with
 status WARNING OK by default (ruleset "Commvault VM summary").

discovery:
 One service on the host running the Commvault REST special agent.
